            owl:onProperty dams:conceptual_implementation_ref ],
        dams:HasGovernanceClassification,
        dams:HasOwnership,
        dams:HasPolicyBindings,
        dams:ModelElement ;
    skos:definition """Версионируемый артефакт модели данных: либо корпоративная conceptual модель (enterprise), либо модель конкретного ИТ-решения (solution). Package-level DAMS layer is dams_model_level on the SpecImpl envelope (ADR-021); implementation_scope here mirrors that body-level semantics.
""" ;
    skos:inScheme <https://data.moex.com/dams/core/v0.1> .

